{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Behold, I rain down.</b> Like the manner of rain falling from the sky." "And the word \"bread\" denotes food: it is found applied to literal bread, also to meat, as לחם אשה (Leviticus 3:11), and also to fruit, as נשחיתה עץ בלחמו (Jeremiah 11)." "And the meaning of \"I test them\" — that he needs me every day."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:58.307093604Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}